            "text": "Questions",
            "tag": "h1",
            "size_enable": true,
            "size_desktop": 52,
            "size_mobile": 36
          }
        },
        "subheading_2": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>About coaching, the programs and sessions in Valencia. Anything else, <a href=\"/pages/contact\">write to me</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab": "1",
            "question": "What is the difference between a program and coaching?",
            "answer": "<p>A program is twelve weeks written for a kind of person. Coaching is written for you, four weeks at a time, and I read every session you log.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab": "1",
            "question": "Do I need a gym?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Every program has a gym version and a home version for dumbbells and a bench. Online coaching works with whatever you have.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab": "1",
            "question": "I have never lifted. Is that a problem?",
            "answer": "<p>Most people I coach started there. The first weeks teach the lifts with light weights and plenty of video feedback.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab": "1",
            "question": "What if I get injured?",
            "answer": "<p>Tell me in your log. We train around it, and I point you to a physio when it needs one. I am a coach, not a doctor.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_7": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab": "1",
            "question": "Do you write meal plans?",
            "answer": "<p>I give simple guidance on protein, meals around training and sleep. For a full meal plan or a medical condition I refer you to a registered dietitian.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_8": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab": "2",
            "question": "How do I get my program?",
            "answer": "<p>Straight after checkout you get a link to the app and an email with the same link. The first week is ready to start.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_9": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab": "2",
            "question": "Which program should I pick?",
            "answer": "<p>Strength Foundations if you are new or coming back. Not sure? Book the free call or send me a message.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_10": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab": "2",
            "question": "Can I swap a program?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, for another program within 14 days. Write to me and it is done the same day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_11": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab": "3",
            "question": "How does online coaching start?",
            "answer": "<p>With the free call. After it you get a short form, then your first four weeks in the app within three days.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_12": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab": "3",
            "question": "How often do we talk?",
            "answer": "<p>Messages in the app any day, a written review every Sunday and a video call once a month.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_13": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab": "3",
            "question": "Can I pause or stop?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Pause or stop before your next month starts, by email or from your account. There is no minimum term.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_14": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab": "3",
            "question": "Where are the sessions in person?",
            "answer": "<p>At a quiet gym in Ruzafa, Valencia. Mornings from 7 and evenings until 9, in packs of 5 or 10.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
